<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley adds Accor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley adds Accor.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accor SA was added to Morgan Stanley's European &quot;fresh money buy list,&quot; replacing Philips Electronics NV of the Netherlands, the investment bank said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Both stocks continue to be rated &quot;strong buy&quot; yet Morgan Stanley pointed out that Philips had risen strongly since it was added to the list last November, outperforming the MSCI European index by some 20 percent in that time.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley set a price target of 960 francs on Accor.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
